() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(1408 leans hard into psychological horror energy, and Mikael Håfström keeps the tone ) Tj
T*
(isolated without letting the movie drift. The best parts are the confidence and control: it ) Tj
T*
(takes its time, sets the trap, then slams the door. It may not be for everybody, but it ) Tj
T*
(definitely has teeth.) Tj
