(Quick Hit:) Tj
T*
(Apostle rips like a ritual-soaked folk nightmare?muddy, violent, with zero interest in ) Tj
T*
(comforting you.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(Apostle leans hard into folk horror energy, and Gareth Evans keeps the tone muddy without ) Tj
T*
(letting the movie drift. It balances style and ugliness the right way, letting the mood get ) Tj
T*
(under your skin before the worst of it lands. Messy in spots, still worth the ride.) Tj
T*
() Tj
