(comforting you.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(Eraserhead leans hard into experimental horror energy, and David Lynch keeps the tone ) Tj
T*
(nightmarish without letting the movie drift. The filmmaking is locked in, the atmosphere is ) Tj
T*
(doing real work, and the payoff earns the damage. Messy in spots, still worth the ride.) Tj
