(Ginger Snaps leans hard into werewolf horror energy, and John Fawcett keeps the tone ) Tj
T*
(sardonic without letting the movie drift. It knows its lane and drives straight into the ) Tj
T*
(dark with style, control, and just enough mean streak. Messy in spots, still worth the ride.) Tj
T*
() Tj
