(High Tension moves like a blade-forward slasher?fast, vicious, and knows exactly when to ) Tj
T*
(twist the knife.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(High Tension leans hard into slasher energy, and Alexandre Aja keeps the tone fast without ) Tj
T*
(letting the movie drift. The best parts are the confidence and control: it takes its time, ) Tj
T*
(sets the trap, then slams the door. Messy in spots, still worth the ride.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Comments:) Tj
