(Quick Hit:) Tj
T*
(Midsommar slides in like a ritual-soaked folk nightmare?bright, cruel, and never loosens its) Tj
T*
( grip.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(Midsommar leans hard into folk horror energy, and Ari Aster keeps the tone bright without ) Tj
T*
(letting the movie drift. This one understands that tension beats noise, so it keeps ) Tj
T*
(tightening the screws until you're stuck in it. This one sticks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
