(Quick Hit:) Tj
T*
(Near Dark unfolds like a bloodsucking mood piece?dusty, mean, and never wastes a scare.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(Near Dark leans hard into vampire horror energy, and Kathryn Bigelow keeps the tone dusty ) Tj
T*
(without letting the movie drift. The best parts are the confidence and control: it takes its) Tj
T*
( time, sets the trap, then slams the door. It may not be for everybody, but it definitely ) Tj
T*
(has teeth.) Tj
