(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(Oculus leans hard into psychological horror energy, and Mike Flanagan keeps the tone trippy ) Tj
T*
(without letting the movie drift. It knows its lane and drives straight into the dark with ) Tj
T*
(style, control, and just enough mean streak. The rough edges are part of the charm.) Tj
