(Rosemary's Baby moves like a head-trip horror piece?paranoid, slow-burn, and knows exactly ) Tj
T*
(when to twist the knife.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(Rosemary's Baby leans hard into psychological horror energy, and Roman Polanski keeps the ) Tj
T*
(tone paranoid without letting the movie drift. The best parts are the confidence and ) Tj
T*
(control: it takes its time, sets the trap, then slams the door. It absolutely earns the spot) Tj
T*
( in a serious horror library.) Tj
