(Session 9 comes off like a head-trip horror piece?unsettling, slow-burn, while the pressure ) Tj
T*
(keeps climbing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(Session 9 leans hard into psychological horror energy, and Brad Anderson keeps the tone ) Tj
T*
(unsettling without letting the movie drift. The craft is sharp, the mood is nasty, and the ) Tj
T*
(pressure keeps building until the whole thing snaps. Not flawless, but the swing is worth ) Tj
T*
(it.) Tj
