(Quick Hit:) Tj
T*
(The Conjuring 2 comes off like a supernatural dread machine?big, polished, while the ) Tj
T*
(pressure keeps climbing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(The Conjuring 2 leans hard into supernatural horror energy, and James Wan keeps the tone big) Tj
T*
( without letting the movie drift. It balances style and ugliness the right way, letting the ) Tj
T*
(mood get under your skin before the worst of it lands. Not flawless, but the swing is worth ) Tj
T*
(it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
