(The Lost Boys feels like a teen-horror rush?fun, stylish, with atmosphere doing half the ) Tj
T*
(killing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(The Lost Boys leans hard into teen horror energy, and Joel Schumacher keeps the tone fun ) Tj
T*
(without letting the movie drift. It balances style and ugliness the right way, letting the ) Tj
T*
(mood get under your skin before the worst of it lands. The rough edges are part of the ) Tj
T*
(charm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
