T*
(Quick Hit:) Tj
T*
(The Neon Demon plays like a head-trip horror piece?stylized, cold, with enough style to make) Tj
T*
( the damage look beautiful.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(The Neon Demon leans hard into psychological horror energy, and Nicolas Winding Refn keeps ) Tj
T*
(the tone stylized without letting the movie drift. The filmmaking is locked in, the ) Tj
T*
(atmosphere is doing real work, and the payoff earns the damage. It may not be for everybody,) Tj
T*
( but it definitely has teeth.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
