(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(The Others leans hard into psychological horror energy, and Alejandro Amenábar keeps the ) Tj
T*
(tone haunting without letting the movie drift. This one understands that tension beats ) Tj
T*
(noise, so it keeps tightening the screws until you're stuck in it. It may not be for ) Tj
T*
(everybody, but it definitely has teeth.) Tj
T*
() Tj
