(The Skin I Live In feels like a head-trip horror piece?cold, disturbing, with atmosphere ) Tj
T*
(doing half the killing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(The Skin I Live In leans hard into psychological horror energy, and Pedro Almodóvar keeps ) Tj
T*
(the tone cold without letting the movie drift. The craft is sharp, the mood is nasty, and ) Tj
T*
(the pressure keeps building until the whole thing snaps. The rough edges are part of the ) Tj
T*
(charm.) Tj
