(Train to Busan plays like an apocalyptic zombie blast?emotional, kinetic, with enough style ) Tj
T*
(to make the damage look beautiful.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full Take:) Tj
T*
(Train to Busan leans hard into zombie horror energy, and Yeon Sang-ho keeps the tone ) Tj
T*
(emotional without letting the movie drift. The filmmaking is locked in, the atmosphere is ) Tj
T*
(doing real work, and the payoff earns the damage. Certified genre fuel.) Tj
